            <ArticleTitle>Ephedrine enhances analgesic effect of morphine.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>396-7</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Morphine-ephedrine interaction on analgesia was studied in mice (n = 240) and in post-operative patients (n = 32). It was found that combining morphine and ephedrine enhances analgesia which is not significantly different from the effect of morphine given alone at double dose.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
